        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CST1RDDSBRRR, Decorative Reed Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis stunningly design decorative door pull is assembled in the USA. This is the most popular entry door pull from the First Impressions product line and for good reason. The Castle Door Pull is a great example of beauty and elegance. Choose from 20 inch, 24 inch, and 30 inch lengths. The Castle 1 Handle is normally used on entry doors, but also used as a <a href=\"/products/castle-appliance-pull-first-impressions-ap-cst1rddrr\"><b>Refrigerator Door Pull</b></a> or just about anywhere a large decorative door pull is needed. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions CST1RDDSBRRR Door Pull:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align =\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>The First Impressions Castle 1 door pull comes standard with the  <a href=\"/products/2-3-4-inch-decorative-reed-rosette-first-impressions-bst03002r\">2-3/4\" Diameter Round Reed Rosettes</a> for an extra level of decoration. The rosettes are removable if desired.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/833-8-detail-picture.jpg?v=1704354557\" target=\"new\"><b>Castle 1 Handle Detailed Picture</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CST01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262217\"><b>First Impressions CST1RDDSBRRR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes</b>\r\n<ul> \r\n<b>CST1020RDDSBRRR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 20\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 13-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CST1024RDDSBRRR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 17-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CST1030RDDSBRRR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 23-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door pull is hand assembled in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Castle 1 Handle",
                "description": "The Castle Collection Series 1 Handle makes a bold statement! Choose from a wide array of different finish colors including Oil Rubbed Bronze, Satin Nickel and Antique Brass. Buy the Castle Door Pull at Doorware.com today.",
